\newlabel{tab:hb_mle}{{3}{3}{RMSE comparison: HB partial pooling vs.\ MLE for confusion matrix estimation ($n_{\text {expert}}$ per scenario). Improvement is largest at small sample sizes where shrinkage provides the greatest benefit. At $n \geq 500$, HB converges to MLE ($<0.5\%$ difference)}{table.caption.5}{}}
