\newlabel{tab:hyperprior}{{4}{3}{Hyperprior sensitivity analysis (Gamma scale $\in \{0.5, 1.0, 2.0\}$). RMSE varies $<1\%$ for $K{=}2$ and $\sim $4--5\% for $K{=}4$; coverage is stable across all settings}{table.caption.6}{}}
